  "reading": "At the pilot n=60 the rate endpoint's J-vs-random difference excludes zero on only 1/4 models (qwen36-27b) \u2014 consistent with G6, which put the n needed for a 10pp margin well above the pilot size. Effect ORDERING under the two endpoints is NOT identical: rate ['olmo3-base', 'olmo31-instruct', 'olmo3-think', 'qwen36-27b'] vs mean ['olmo3-base', 'olmo3-think', 'olmo31-instruct', 'qwen36-27b'] \u2014 Think and Instruct exchange places, so the rate endpoint is not a free relabeling of the mean ladder and HP1's ordering claim must be restated for whichever endpoint the freeze adopts. Threshold sensitivity is reported so the freeze picks a value with its arbitrariness visible; the pilot-frozen -1.0 nat is used throughout and any change is a deviation to log.",
  "caveat": "pilot items only (dev tier, excluded from confirmatory statistics by prereg); one-hop cells inherit the batteries' ceiling limitation for base/Think \u2014 the hard one-hop set is the confirmatory replacement",
